WEBVTT

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:14.460
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.700
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:22.040
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.140
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:29.080
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:41.660
You finally woke up, huh?

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.700
<i>Hotel plus underwear</i> <i>plus Tokiko in street clothes...!</i>

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:52.610
What the heck happened to me?!

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:57.740
<i>Another New Life</i>

00:00:58.450 --> 00:01:01.250
You fell asleep as you were last night,

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:04.210
so l just carried you to the hotel where l'm staying

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:05.750
which is closer than the dorm.

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:07.950
What did you think?

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:09.980
Nothing.

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:15.390
So you are staying in a place like this.
That's a bit of a surprise.

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:19.930
Did you think l lived in the clouds and ate mist or something?

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:23.500
That is very rude of you!

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:28.580
<i>Come to think of it,</i> <i>l don't know anything about Tokiko...</i>

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:32.070
Say, where do you go to school and what year are you in?

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:36.210
Why the sudden interest? l don't go to school.

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:40.120
That uniform is from the school l infiltrated during my previous mission.

00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:43.220
lf l were normally going to school,

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.660
l'd be in my third year of high school this year.

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:46.920
Oh, so you are older than me!

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:49.620
Are you glad that l'm older?

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:54.130
But why did you become a warrior, Tokiko?

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:59.600
Because l hate all...homunculi.

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:03.670
Rather than a silly interogation,

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.800
we should be searching for the Creator, right?

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:08.680
Since today's Saturday, we'll spend the whole day.

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:10.350
Oh... Right...

00:02:11.220 --> 00:02:14.780
<i>That must've been something</i> <i>l shouldn't carelessly touch upon. Sorry...</i>

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:20.050
<i>Tokiko is fighting the man-eating monsters</i> <i>and protecting everyone.</i>

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:22.060
<i>That's good enough for now!</i>

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:23.760
<i>More importantly...</i>

00:02:24.070 --> 00:02:26.930
<i>we only have two days left to save her!</i>

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:29.600
<i>Concentrate only on that now!</i>

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:33.100
Listen up. We didn't find the Creator

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:35.670
in the search at the school in the four days up until yesterday.

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:38.000
But it also proves those who were absent

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.380
for those four straight days are under suspicion.

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:42.840
And the words of the enemy you defeated...

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:46.010
<i>Ohh, right, right.</i>
<i>You guys just don't follow through.</i>

00:02:46.090 --> 00:02:48.390
<i>The facilities used by the students</i> <i>aren't just the school building.</i>

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:51.190
A school facility other than the school building...

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:55.890
The dorm! You go to the dorm and find the boarding student

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:59.230
who was absent from school for four straight days!

00:02:59.630 --> 00:03:01.230
Huh? What about you, Tokiko?

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:05.700
l'm going to sneak into the school and check the attendance record.

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:06.900
Oh, but...

00:03:06.970 --> 00:03:07.810
What is it?

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:09.100
About that note from before.

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:12.410
To be honest, it's difficult to describe the characteristics with just that.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:15.310
l see. Then shall we try drawing a composite sketch?

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:17.590
But l don't have any drawing talent.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:18.940
lt's okay!

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:22.350
As a matter of fact, l'm a master of composite sketches!

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:25.750
You're talking now without thinking about anything, aren't you?

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:27.220
Finished!

00:03:28.030 --> 00:03:30.400
That's really good!
But it doesn't really look like him!

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:32.230
Then, l'm counting on you.

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:33.200
Right!

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.330
<i>Day 5</i>

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:40.900
l'm looking for this guy!
Have you seen him somewhere?!

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:43.770
What do you want from a peeping tom anyway, darn it?!

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:46.780
By the way, where did you stay last night?

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:49.280
More importantly, who the heck is Tokiko really?

00:03:49.420 --> 00:03:51.320
Whoa! He's a super weirdo!

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:53.250
What's the deal with Okakura?

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:54.890
That would be from...

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:58.150
Tokiko...

00:03:58.260 --> 00:03:58.950
Wha--?!

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.930
<i>Are you glad that l'm older?</i>

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:05.330
Older...

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.370
What about an older person, Big Brother?

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:10.330
Well, we're not doing anything, so shall we also look for him?

00:04:10.470 --> 00:04:11.170
Right.

00:04:11.940 --> 00:04:17.140
From 5'9" to 5'11" in height.
Slim. Good posture.

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:19.150
Black hair parted in the front.

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:22.510
Skin is considered to be more pale than fair...

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:25.710
Hmm... lt seems nobody knows.

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:28.980
He seems surprisingly ordinary, so you'd think we'd find him right away...

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:33.660
ls this that bad? l put all of my effort into each stroke.

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:35.320
Oh. Hey, over there.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:37.660
lt's a green armband, so he's a third-year student!

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:39.470
Let's try asking!

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:41.500
Excuse me.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:47.500
l have something l'd like to ask...

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:49.040
Oh, just a minute.

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:51.440
Could you let me take my medication first?

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:56.140
Whoa, he's taking it all.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:58.580
Are you okay taking so much?

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:01.820
l'm <i>not</i> okay.

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:04.990
But my body won't hold up if l don't take it.

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:06.690
Are you in poor health?

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:07.730
You could say that...

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:09.800
So, is there something you want with me?

00:05:09.860 --> 00:05:11.130
Oh, right.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:13.100
We're looking for a male third-year boarding student

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:17.130
who's been absent from school for the four days up until yesterday...

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:20.710
So far, no matter who we ask, the answer is there's no such guy.

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:26.440
l see... No such guy, huh?

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:31.480
lf that's the case, then l bet he's an invisible presence.

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:32.850
—What?
—lnvisible?

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:37.090
Only perceived as a part of the background, even if seen...

00:05:37.530 --> 00:05:40.050
There is always one like that in every class.

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:44.990
A classmate nobody takes notice of whether he's there or not.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:46.960
A presence of that sort...

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.200
l feel bad for him...

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:53.860
ls there nothing else you know about him?

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:57.540
Just a couple of characteristics and this composite sketch.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:00.710
All my effort into each stroke!

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:05.250
l guess such a person isn't here, after all. lf he were, he's just a looney.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:08.880
Really? l think he's pretty cool if it were just the mask.

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:11.220
Big Brother, your definition of cool is completely off!

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:12.350
No, he's correct!

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:13.420
What?!

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:19.560
Yes. This mask is wonderful.
Butterflies are wonderful!

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:24.160
They transform from an ugly caterpillar nobody would take notice of

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:29.040
into a beautiful form everyone can't help but take notice of!

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:36.880
The papillon mask is the symbol of a splendid transformation.

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:38.940
<i>You'll know by the looks of his eyes.</i>

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:41.350
<i>lt's the color of a rotten river.</i>

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:45.160
<i>From 5'9" to 5'1 1" in height.</i>

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:49.200
<i>Slim. Good posture.</i>
<i>Black hair parted in the front.</i>

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:52.290
<i>Skin more pale than fair...</i>

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:55.970
Mahiro, what do you say we go for lunch now?

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:57.440
Huh? Okay.

00:06:57.570 --> 00:07:00.770
Go ahead and wait at the entrance with Rokumasu and the others.

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:02.000
Oh, okay...

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:08.450
l've been staying at this dorm for the past year.

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:12.020
But l don't remember seeing your face...

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:13.780
l told you...

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:17.020
He is an invisible presence.

00:07:17.430 --> 00:07:19.720
He's always just a part of the background.

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:22.900
And...in two more days...

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:29.700
l found him, Kazuki!

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:31.670
There is indeed a third-year boarding student

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:33.800
who was absent for four straight days!

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:36.040
Class 3-C, attendance number eight!

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:41.140
Koshaku Chono, age nineteen!
He's the Creator in the papillon mask!

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:44.750
The weakest caterpillar that can't even maintain...

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:46.410
life on its own...

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:50.290
But he found it.

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:54.030
The great power of alchemy!

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:57.360
The method for splendid transformation!

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:03.030
<i>This guy is the homunculi Creator in</i> <i>the Papillon Mask!</i>

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.970
<i>There won't be any more victims</i> <i>if l can catch him here.</i>

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:07.330
<i>And Tokiko will be saved!</i>

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.640
<i>I'll be there in five minutes! Wait there!</i>

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:15.550
<i>l don't know the extent of his power,</i>

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:17.550
<i>but I'll catch him here no matter what!</i>

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:18.650
Buso Ren--!

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:20.350
Stop! Okay, that's as far as you go.

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:21.590
That...!

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:24.920
Correct. lt's the homunculus embryo antidote.

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:28.150
lt's a countermeasure l made for myself in case of an experimental accident.

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:30.860
So it's a very rare item, the only one.

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:35.640
l just completed the final experiment now, so l don't need it anymore.

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:37.030
But without this,

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:40.870
your friend will turn into a homunculus in two days, right?

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:45.140
So how about exchanging it for your kakugane?

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:50.170
The other achievement of alchemy, along with the homunculi.

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:53.920
l'd heard stories, but after seeing it the other day with my own eyes

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:56.220
it has drawn my interest as the next topic of research...

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:57.260
What will you do?

00:08:57.360 --> 00:09:00.230
lf you don't need it,
I'll just dump it into the sewer.

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:02.390
Even if you were to say you want it after all,

00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:05.960
it takes time to produce, and by then it'll be too late.

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:10.660
Now, what will you do?

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:14.770
No!

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:16.940
l can't hand this over to you.

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:19.000
Well, l thought you'd say that.

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:21.710
There is no question if you were to let go of your weapon,

00:09:21.780 --> 00:09:23.310
you will be at a total disadvantage.

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:26.550
l myself would value my life the most.

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:30.190
No! I'll die if l part with the kakugane,

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:32.060
so l wouldn't be able to deliver the medicine to Tokiko

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.490
even l were to get my hands on it!

00:09:33.690 --> 00:09:36.720
What do you mean? Tell me.

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:38.160
l've been killed once

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:42.530
by getting my heart pierced by a homunculus you created.

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:45.740
But l was able to come back to life

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:49.740
by using the kakugane as a replacement for my heart...

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:55.540
So this kakugane embedded in my heart is also serving as my new life!

00:10:03.390 --> 00:10:05.920
Life! New life!

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:09.060
Amazing, a kakugane has such a power?!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:12.860
You were able to obtain new life just like that?!

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:17.860
<i>This guy's bad news!</i>

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:21.740
Give it to me! Give me new life!

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:26.540
Many people have lost their lives on account of the homunculi you created!

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:29.780
And yet why should l give you new life?

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:31.440
Don't say selfish things!

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:35.980
<i>Uh, oh! l didn't mean to...</i>

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:39.090
Tokiko!

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:42.230
That's the homunculus antidote!

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:46.330
Too bad. lt's a fake. lt's not even a placebo.

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:49.500
The real thing is a shot that's injected directly into the embryo.

00:10:49.740 --> 00:10:50.570
<i>l've been had!</i>

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:54.340
You caught the Papillon Mask, huh?
Good job.

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:56.810
Yeah. But it's kind of weird.

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:59.380
He's pretty weak considering he's a boss and ringleader.

00:10:59.710 --> 00:11:04.310
Of course. He hasn't acquired the training to fight like l have.

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:07.150
Other than making the creation of homunculi possible,

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:08.520
he's just an ordinary human...

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:13.920
l snatched his personal record from the school... Koshaku Chono.

00:11:14.660 --> 00:11:15.960
The eldest son of a wealthy family

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:17.970
that's operated a trade business since the Meiji Period.

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:21.960
He got a perfect 500 score in five subjects on his entrance exam.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:23.960
He has an lQ of 230.

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:26.970
lf l'd gone regularly, l was supposed to become

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.700
the greatest genius since the establishment of the school.

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:30.800
Was?

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:34.440
l came down with an unknown disease just after entering school.

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:36.450
There's no cure.

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:40.820
My immune strength will drop and will result in certain death.

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:44.050
l've been in and out of the hospital and repeated years in school twice.

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:46.990
l've been living in this room like a recluse ever since.

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:50.360
There are hardly any students who know this guy.

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.970
And even the teachers have thrown in the towel...

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:57.170
See, don't you feel sorry for him just like l said?

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:01.030
Let me ask you one thing.

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:06.500
Where did you obtain alchemy... and the skills to create homunculi?

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:09.210
A research log covering half a century

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:12.050
belonging to my great-great-grandfather who started trade with the West.

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:15.950
l found it in the storehouse of my home and spent three years completing it.

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:19.050
lncredible, if l do say so myself...

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:22.960
Why did you create the likes of the homunculi monsters?

00:12:23.230 --> 00:12:25.130
l already know about that.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:28.170
My speculation changed to conviction after seeing this.

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:32.100
The bodies until now were all prototypes!

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:34.810
This 21st embryo is his finalized product!

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:39.110
He intends to use this and turn himself into a homunculus!

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:44.070
With ordinary power, a homunculus will always regenerate, albeit slowly,

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:46.020
even if smashed to bits.

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:50.880
That powerful flesh that will not take on any other power except alchemy

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:54.030
is the closest thing there is in this world to immortality.

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:57.730
His goal is to discard his diseased human body

00:12:57.800 --> 00:13:00.600
and obtain an immortal homunculus body!

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:02.740
But! As l recall, the human dies

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:05.570
once a homunculus embryo attaches itself!

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:09.110
Yeah. The mind is killed and the flesh is taken away.

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:12.140
However, there is one homunculus exception...

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:13.240
Right.

00:13:13.580 --> 00:13:15.950
That is what l was striving for...

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:18.550
the ultimate humanoid homunculus!

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:22.250
This 21st embryo is, in a matter of speaking,

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:23.880
an offshoot using my cells as a base!

00:13:24.430 --> 00:13:26.260
lf fused with an offshoot,

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:29.060
the mind will assimilate and remain without being killed.

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:33.330
And then the flesh will get as close to immortal as you can get in this world!

00:13:34.570 --> 00:13:37.600
Animal-types and plant-types are mere monsters,

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:41.100
but this humanoid homunculus is superhuman!

00:13:41.510 --> 00:13:44.970
But, it's still a homunculus which eats people, right?

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:50.080
Sacrificing the lives of so many people until now...

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:52.920
Do you want to live that badly?!

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:58.620
Yeah, l do. l told you before.
Everyone values their own life the most.

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:04.230
I'll do whatever it takes to live.
What about you?

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:06.360
You've died once, right?

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:11.130
lf you say you don't want to live, then just stay dead.

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:15.610
You who came back to life with ease are telling me to die like this?

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:18.700
You're telling me to accept my destiny of sickness and die?

00:14:19.010 --> 00:14:20.040
Die.

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:23.510
You won't be able to become superhuman either way!

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.510
That thing will be destroyed here immediately!

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:28.090
No! lt'll be complete in two days!

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:31.350
Using that I'll turn from a caterpillar into a butterfly!

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:34.490
That's my new life!

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:36.990
What's that?!

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.560
lf l'm not mistaken, this is... the last one!

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:40.900
The eagle-type homunculus!

00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:49.570
lt's coming!

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:56.550
Are you okay... Master?

00:14:59.490 --> 00:15:01.010
Alchemist warrior...

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.120
How dare you do this to my master!

00:15:03.390 --> 00:15:05.190
The tables are turned!

00:15:06.430 --> 00:15:09.490
Girl! Turn into a monster and die!

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:11.800
I'll turn into a superhuman and live!

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:16.300
I'll stop both... the monster and the superhuman!

00:15:16.800 --> 00:15:18.830
You're going to stop me... l see.

00:15:19.010 --> 00:15:22.640
So in other words, you're also saying for me to die like this?

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:26.040
No! l can't just thoughtlessly say something like "die" to a person!

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:29.140
l am saying make amends to the people you sacrificed until now

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:32.050
and then live until the very end of your life!

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:37.750
Master, leave this to me and please escape quickly.

00:15:38.260 --> 00:15:40.280
We don't have time for a verbal dispute, Kazuki.

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:41.960
People will soon be here.

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:42.990
What?!

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:44.260
What the heck happened?!

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:46.930
Have the police and the fire department been contacted?

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:49.130
—Was there an explosion?
—l saw it! lt's a meteor!

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:51.840
What? He's not here! Kazuki isn't here!

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:52.730
What?!

00:15:53.110 --> 00:15:57.570
All right! You catch the Papillon Mask!
I'll hold off Washio!

00:15:57.740 --> 00:15:58.400
What?

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:01.670
My lance should be faster at this distance!

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.250
lt'll hit in an instant!

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:06.090
You're going to challenge me with speed?

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:08.910
<i>True... lt'd be different in the air,</i>

00:16:08.990 --> 00:16:10.620
<i>but in this closed space</i>
<i>Kazuki can make the first strike</i>

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:12.630
<i>before the homunculus completes</i> <i>his transformation!</i>

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:14.250
Okay, let's go!

00:16:14.460 --> 00:16:15.290
Buso...

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:19.260
Underestimating me will be your downfall!

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:20.730
Prepare yourself!

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:23.000
The embryos up to now...

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:25.040
were all products of animal experimentation

00:16:25.110 --> 00:16:28.370
in order to become a humanoid homunculus,

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:30.570
in others words, to create my new life!

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:33.240
But this hawk homunculus, Washio,

00:16:33.310 --> 00:16:35.580
is in a different league from the ones you've fought.

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:42.880
<i>l don't know what it is...</i>

00:16:43.090 --> 00:16:45.460
<i>l've got kind of a bad feeling...</i>

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:54.430
<i>l am saying make amends to</i> <i>the people you sacrificed until now</i>

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:56.990
<i>and then live until</i> <i>the very end of your life!</i>

00:16:57.600 --> 00:17:00.230
A hypocrite who does nothing but speak fine words...

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:03.000
He's the type l hate most.

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:08.410
Yet again, l've lost the place l can belong to...

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:13.980
For the next two days, where am l suppose to go to?

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:19.430
<i>l can't breathe!</i>

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:21.430
<i>At this rate...</i>

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:22.890
Tokiko!

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:24.400
l know! Let's go!

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:27.070
—Buso Renkin!
—Buso Renkin!

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:43.320
Tokiko!

00:17:43.880 --> 00:17:46.410
l'm okay! Take my hand.

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:54.560
We're going to land!

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:58.890
lt'll be difficult to support the weight of two people with the Valkryie Skirt,

00:17:59.070 --> 00:17:59.930
but I'll try!

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:02.290
Wait! Leave this to me!

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:06.140
<i>The special property of the lance,</i>
<i>Buso Renkin, is this ornamental cloth!</i>

00:18:06.510 --> 00:18:09.640
<i>lt becomes energy and activates</i> <i>acting in concert with my will!</i>

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:12.840
Burst, my Buso Renkin!

00:18:21.090 --> 00:18:24.180
<i>With energy from the cloth,</i> <i>he cancelled out the impact of our fall.</i>

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:27.660
<i>As l suspected,</i> <i>this Buso Renkin is powerful!</i>

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:33.000
<i>And though gradual, Kazuki's starting</i> <i>to master its use for certain!</i>

00:18:35.270 --> 00:18:36.290
That was close.

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:38.270
You've got some nice powers...

00:18:39.770 --> 00:18:41.870
Just what l'd expect of an alchemist warrior!

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:46.670
Just one part of his body has transformed into a homunculus!

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:50.910
l get it... This way his transformations and attacks are much quicker.

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:53.390
He is indeed in a different league!

00:18:53.450 --> 00:18:55.220
My soul is shaking...

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:57.650
lf you guys are my opponents,

00:18:57.720 --> 00:19:00.790
l should be able to display my power as much as l like.

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:03.290
The final homunculus!

00:19:03.360 --> 00:19:06.490
lf we defeat him, all that's left is the Papillon Mask!

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:09.630
I'll defeat all who do harm to my master!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:10.770
—Here we go!
—Here we go!

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:15.310
That wing is mine!

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:16.740
l know.

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:20.150
<i>lt's hard? No. This is...!</i>

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:22.170
<i>No matter how swift the blade,</i>

00:19:22.250 --> 00:19:24.980
<i>as long as the angle of the blade</i> <i>is not erect, it's impossible to cut.</i>

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:28.980
Dodge it, Tokiko!

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:31.550
Energy full blast!

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:34.750
Eat this! Jousting Slasher!

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:39.570
<i>Did he miss?! No. This is...!</i>

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:41.090
l know...

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:43.730
No matter how sharp the spear tip,

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:46.670
it's possible to evade if l slightly displace the tip!

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:48.740
Not yet!
One more time!

00:19:48.810 --> 00:19:49.740
Slice down!

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:52.310
l've grasped your speed now.

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:59.110
l know. This is what's called reading the enemy's attack.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:02.710
<i>This monster...</i>

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:06.020
<i>He's in a different league from</i> <i>the other homunculi!</i>

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:07.590
He's coming!

00:20:07.660 --> 00:20:08.320
You little...!

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:17.530
The fifth day is ending.
Only one day left.

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:22.030
After you leave tomorrow morning, my life shall end by my own hands.

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:25.000
Next time, "To Protect Someone."

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:27.270
I'll splatter your guts out!
